{"channelId":"UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","row":["Gentle Storm Horse Sanctuary",1190000,"Gentle Storm Horse Sanctuary exists to rescue horses trapped in auction pipelines and facing slaughter in Mexico.\nThese horses often come from lives of neglect, overwork, abuse, and abandonment — sold through auctions and pushed toward slaughterhouses with no voice and no time left.\n\nWe are the gentle storm that steps in.\nWhen chaos, fear, and cruelty surround them, we intervene with urgency, compassion, and unwavering commitment.\n\nAt our sanctuary, rescued horses receive:\n• Emergency rescue from auctions and slaughter routes\n• Medical care, rehabilitation, and trauma recovery\n• Safety, patience, and respect\n• A chance to heal after the storm has passed\n\nThey have survived the storm.\nNow they deserve gentleness.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:54.429Z","channelId":"UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7864005a25a37878752fad2f16f00e6d8a2b703ffe5bf4555edbaf505b7427a3","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"4e6af3816a44d03c9fb124a4662965b79fd7ae0edbd57f8a2385517d69bcd977"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:16:38.021Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1190000,"raw":"1.19M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi18dxA02OPX--Ccisesg9w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:54.429Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourc